% arising from its use.

the target language is: lps.

the maximum time is 5.

the actions are:
    the move mark with *an index* and *a second index* is made; known as mark.

the fluents are:
    *an index* cell *a second index* with *a player*; known as cell.
    *a role* is a control; known as control.
    the move mark with *an index* and *a second index* is legal; known as legal_mark.
    open; known as open.
    *a thing* is a right; known as right.
    *a player* is a touch; known as touch.
    *a thing* is the up of *a second thing*; known as up.
    the goal of *a role* is *a number*; known as goal.
    the game is terminal; known as terminal.

the templates are:
    the succ of *a thing* is *a second thing*.

the knowledge base donttouch includes:

the text of the game is at "sources/donttouch.hrf".

the succ of 1 is 2.

the succ of 2 is 3.

the succ of 3 is 4.

the succ of 4 is 5.

the succ of 5 is 6.

the succ of 6 is 7.

the succ of 7 is 8.

the move mark with an index and a second index is legal at a time if
    the index cell the second index with b at the time.

the goal of x is 0 at a time if
    x is a touch at the time
    and it is not the case that o is a touch at the time.

the goal of x is 50 at a time if
    it is not the case that x is a touch at the time
    and it is not the case that o is a touch at the time.

the goal of x is 100 at a time if
    it is not the case that x is a touch at the time
    and o is a touch at the time.

the goal of o is 0 at a time if
    it is not the case that x is a touch at the time
    and o is a touch at the time.

the goal of o is 50 at a time if
    it is not the case that x is a touch at the time
    and it is not the case that o is a touch at the time.

the goal of o is 100 at a time if
    x is a touch at the time
    and it is not the case that o is a touch at the time.

the game is terminal at a time if
    x is a touch at the time.

the game is terminal at a time if
    o is a touch at the time.

the game is terminal at a time if
    it is not the case that open at the time.

a thing is the up of a second thing at a time if
    the succ of the thing is a third thing
    and the thing cell 1 with the second thing at the time.

a thing is a right at a time if
    1 cell 3 with the thing at the time
    and 2 cell 2 with the thing at the time
    and 3 cell 1 with the thing at the time.

a player is a touch at a time if
    an index cell a second index with the player at the time
    and the succ of the index is a thing
    and the thing cell the second index with the player at the time.

a player is a touch at a time if
    an index cell a second index with the player at the time
    and the succ of the second index is a thing
    and the index cell the thing with the player at the time.

open at a time if
    an index cell a second index with b at the time.

when the move mark with an index and a second index is made
    and a role is a control
then the index cell the second index with the role
    and it is not the case that the index cell the second index with b.

when the move mark with an index and a second index is made
    and x is a control
then o is a control
    and it is not the case that x is a control.

when the move mark with an index and a second index is made
    and o is a control
then x is a control
    and it is not the case that o is a control.

it must not be true that
    the move mark with an index and a second index is made
    and it is not the case that the move mark with the index and the second index is legal.

initially 1 cell 1 with b
    and 1 cell 2 with b
    and 1 cell 3 with b
    and 1 cell 4 with b
    and 2 cell 1 with b
    and 2 cell 2 with b
    and 2 cell 3 with b
    and 2 cell 4 with b
    and 3 cell 1 with b
    and 3 cell 2 with b
    and 3 cell 3 with b
    and 3 cell 4 with b
    and 4 cell 1 with b
    and 4 cell 2 with b
    and 4 cell 3 with b
    and 4 cell 4 with b
    and x is a control.

% EpilogJS's state after the play (the twin's final state under LPS2 must be the same):
%   - control(o)
%   - cell(1,1,x)
%   - cell(1,2,x)
%   - cell(1,3,b)
%   - cell(1,4,b)
%   - cell(2,1,b)
%   - cell(2,2,b)
%   - cell(2,3,b)
%   - cell(2,4,b)
%   - cell(3,1,o)
%   - cell(3,2,b)
%   - cell(3,3,b)
%   - cell(3,4,b)
%   - cell(4,1,b)
%   - cell(4,2,b)
%   - cell(4,3,b)
%   - cell(4,4,b)
scenario play is:
    the move mark with 1 and 1 is made from 1 to 2.
    the move mark with 3 and 1 is made from 2 to 3.
    the move mark with 1 and 2 is made from 3 to 4.

